  article.portfolio-about
    .inner-wrapper.flex-row-wrap.two-col
      .about-intro-box.box
        h1 Jesus Colina
        p Full Stack JavaScript Developer

        .about-bio
          p I've been curious about computers since I was a kid, always poking around to figure out how things worked. That curiosity grew into a love for programming, because code lets me take a problem and build my own solution to it, which never stops being fun. I'm drawn to the tech world as a whole, and I'm happiest when I'm learning something new. Through the Treehouse Full Stack JavaScript Techdegree, I've built a random quote generator, a searchable student directory, an interactive registration form, an object-oriented word game and an employee directory powered by a public API. I'm looking for a team where I can keep building, keep learning, and help solve real problems.

      .skills-contact-box.box
        h6 Skills
        ul
          li HTML
          li CSS
          li JavaScript
          li Git and GitHub
          li VS Code
          li Accessibility
          li OOP
          li Fetch and Public APIs
          li Node.js
          li Express
          li Pug

        h6 Contact Info
